WEBVTT

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.630
Somebody…

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.510
Save us…

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.390
The Academy is…

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:38.690
My friends are…

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.210
Yuki… Everyone…

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:09.880
Wait for me.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.050
Hey, boy.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.350
Should you really be wandering around here at a time like this?

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:17.470
You’re…

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:22.390
I met with you once after you lost your memory.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:23.810
Don’t you remember?

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:30.570
You were the accident investigator, weren’t you?

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.360
That was a lie.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.040
I am Alphonse Medici Borgiani.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.880
Though I may not look it, I hold a lordship.

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:50.010
Dermailles and I are the wings that hold up the Royal Family.

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:54.590
Although, I am the individual in charge of secret missions.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:56.510
Then could you be…

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:58.930
…the one who kidnapped that kid?!

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.720
Correct.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.560
It seems to be something you have an issue with.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.900
I am the one who carried out the mission.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.980
If you’re blaming the Princess, you have the wrong person.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:11.940
She’s the one who approved it!

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:13.400
She’s an accomplice.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:17.990
I only wished to fulfill my obligation to Her Royal Highness as a statesman.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.620
On the other hand, what about you?

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:29.920
I thought you had thrown away your façade of serving the Princess,

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.880
but why are you also throwing away the friends you swore to protect?

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:33.880
It can’t be…!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.800
Alphonse-sama.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.130
The thirteenth lift has been prepared.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:42.100
The team monitoring the church was attacked.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.560
Traitors have broken into the church, and it is currently under siege.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.940
Come with me if you wish to hurry.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.160
So you do keep your promises.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.910
Though, it’s too late to deliver weapons to the church.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:02.540
Shut up.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.920
I see he has inherited your useless stubbornness, Wolf.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.590
Dad!

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.710
Listen, Akira.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.300
When you failed your mission one year ago and lost your memory,

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.850
only two choices were left to me:

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:24.640
Since you had become useless,
it was either kill you or not.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.600
By the way, I was in favor of killing you.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.360
And there was talk of you being made an example, as well.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.570
But in the end,

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.210
we told Her Majesty that you had gone missing during a mission.

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:43.360
We decided to allow you to live.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:46.750
Do not make me regret that decision!

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:55.710
It means that your existence is that important to Her Majesty.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.880
I don’t know how you feel about her, though.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.220
Listen well, Akira.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.100
If you leave now, know that you will never be able to return.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.520
Are you still prepared?

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:10.520
Of course.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.650
But I’m not leaving because of what you two have told me.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.490
This is a problem between me and the Princess.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.750
No!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.770
No, forgive me!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.190
Praying won’t help you.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:45.990
Real vampires don’t fear God or crosses.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:46.830
Understand?

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.830
We don’t fear anything.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.320
We have no need to.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:55.750
Those girls will feel joy when they open their eyes as vampires, as well.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:56.790
That can’t be…

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.590
A vampire’s kiss is the ultimate pleasure.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:08.550
In comparison, not even sex can come anywhere close to that.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.930
Now, Sister…

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.020
You’ve sealed away your youthful body with devotion.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:18.690
Since you have been forced into such abstinence, I would like you to experience this pleasure.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:19.440
No!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:20.560
All of you.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.440
Here’s the long-awaited Sister Laura!

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.160
Sister!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.420
I’m sorry, everyone.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.170
Now, it’s your turn.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.720
Ever since she became a vampire,

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.510
I haven’t let her drink a single drop of blood.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.260
Would you mind giving her some?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:59.230
I’m sorry, Yuki-chan.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.610
I’m at my limit.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:03.360
No!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:03.980
No!!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.530
So… please!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:10.530
After you become ours,

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.160
I’ll let you play around with that dog…

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.540
…with this silver sword.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:17.410
I’ll be looking forward to it!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.170
No!

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.290
No!!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.260
Akira-kun!!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.430
You should refrain from addressing my servant in that manner.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.610
It has begun.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:46.940
Attacks by the multiplying vampires are occurring throughout the world.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:54.330
Those who don’t cover their tracks and only wish to show their strength have appeared.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.750
I moved quite secretly as well, but it didn’t do any good.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.420
Or so it would appear.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.090
Vampires were exposed to the world in bright sunlight…

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.720
…as the strongest and worst natural enemies of humans.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:14.920
What kind of opposition and disorder will this cause throughout the world?

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.730
You should have seen it at the Academy.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.060
To prevent that disastrous conflict from occurring,

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:26.480
we shall show, with our own hands, that vampires are beings under control.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.360
That is…

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.860
The Vampire Bund.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.110
Yes.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:34.910
The ones behind the manipulation of Mizoguchi,

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.450
this troubling affair at the Academy,

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.250
the terror during that interview,

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:42.250
and that incident when the Princess went to greet you…

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.920
If you go further back,

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:47.630
even the one who appeared on that TV show is of the same origin.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:52.430
In seeking to destroy the order between humans and vampires that has been established for millennia,

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:55.890
the ones behind this aim to thrust the world into chaos.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.430
Their darkness runs much deeper than ours.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:01.310
So we must drag them out and crush them.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:04.020
Her Majesty is determined to fight.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.900
She has deceived even her allies from time to time,

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:11.490
and when necessary, made use of the feelings towards what one cherishes the most.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.360
That is how determined she is.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.110
Princess…

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.870
And with this recent occurrence,

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.620
we are finally beginning to see the form of our enemy.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.120
Who are they?

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.250
Their name is…

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.340
Telomere.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:30.420
You do appear like an organization that would name itself thus,

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.050
Jean Marais Dermailles.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:38.180
I am honored that you already know the names of both myself and my organization.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:41.470
Pardon the rudeness shown by my people some time ago.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:45.980
Is your father involved with this?

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:50.740
No, even our fathers are old-fashioned towards us.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.240
They are only obstacles that must be brought down.

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:58.700
A youngster from a noble family playing with fire out of boredom.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:02.790
You controlled Mizoguchi and assaulted the Academy.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.750
What are you scheming?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.750
What do you desire?

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:08.630
Everything.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.460
Oh?

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.800
Doesn’t Your Royal Highness think so as well?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.850
Our existence, as well as that of the humans, will soon reach the limit.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:25.650
The great power the Queen of the Vampires wields is also limited by that annoying something.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:28.250
This also applies to the human world as well.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.990
What’s needed now is a new framework.

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.650
A new power.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.450
A new ruler.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:39.450
And that ruler can only be you.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:45.750
It is time to pave a new principle of royalty with us!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.550
A principle of royalty, huh?

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:56.960
I see.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.090
Your Majesty…

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:03.680
You speak and fight for such a misguided ideal.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.470
For such a…

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.710
Am I…

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:15.610
Am I surrounded only by those who cannot understand me?

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.450
Why do you say this?

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:21.830
Your Majesty, did you not create the Vampire Bund for this very purpose?

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.450
Silence, you insect.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.830
You dare to say that you can bear the weight of my kingdom?!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:37.930
I am not quite sure what you are attempting to do,

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.590
but we do not exist for such a purpose.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:41.970
Why wouldn’t we?

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:45.310
After all, we cannot exist without humans.

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:48.190
We are beings that feed off of human lives.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:51.060
We are just travelers in human form,

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:56.650
wishing for a fleeting place to rest.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.570
That is the purpose of the Bund,

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.990
and the purpose of the Academy.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.120
Even if only for a little while,

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.960
I wished to live like a human.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.420
Just for a little while,

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.340
I wanted to live like a normal girl.

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.340
Princess.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:18.760
But the results are as you see.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:22.090
All of this was caused by my naïvety.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.970
I shall accept this retribution.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.660
Please, Your Majesty.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.850
If you do not follow our advice,

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.440
we will be forced to—

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.730
Know your place!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:35.860
Do you believe you will be able to even touch me?

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.990
Transformed, eh?

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:50.240
It truly is a fitting form for your pathetic self.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.000
Halt!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.670
If you are Dermailles’ son,

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.380
you were never able to go against me in the first place.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.090
Such a powerless insect.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.930
You have failed me, and even attempted to harm me.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.180
Please forgive me. Please…

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.060
I shall not.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:16.880
Your Royal…

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.530
…Highness!

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.270
He didn’t dodge? This…

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.280
It appears the victor is clear.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.000
The world is going to change.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.000
Rather, with our power, we will change it.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:36.790
For that purpose, we will have you disappear, vampire!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.300
Stop!

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.050
Yuki!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:50.930
You mongrel!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.280
I was defeated by the likes of you?

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.410
Jean…

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.290
I’d heard that Telomere also had human sympathizers,

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.710
but I never would have thought you’d be one of them,

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:18.290
Vice President.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.630
Master was…

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.980
Hurry and inject the vaccine into the girls who were bitten.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.350
We may still be able to reverse the process.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:50.610
Princess.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:52.990
Akira.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:55.120
Her Highness…

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.060
Hey, let’s go.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.680
It’s over, right?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.140
Not yet.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:16.850
That’s right.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.770
What? Why not?

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.440
There are reasons.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:25.570
I have my feelings, and you have your own.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:31.450
Once the sword is drawn, it cannot be sheathed until a battle is fought.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.870
Right, Akira?

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:34.500
Yeah.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.130
Once upon a time,

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:41.170
a lone boy posed a question to the great demon queen.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:45.350
“You always stare down at the world with such a sad face.”

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.420
“Are you going to do that forever?”

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:52.550
I couldn’t believe in you, or even believe in myself.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:57.060
But you always fought so hard alone.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.560
I do not need your pity!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.190
The queen replied:

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:05.650
“If you promise to grant my wish,

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.360
then I will stop being sad.”

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.820
“But if you break that promise…”

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.950
I want to take you.

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:17.290
I want to make you my possession.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.830
That is my weakness.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.540
My strong desire of the past!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.590
“I will feast upon your flesh.”

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.550
I understand.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.420
I understand now.

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:32.920
We can no longer return to how we were in the past.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:37.800
If we can no longer return to how we were,

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:40.560
then let everything be destroyed!

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:43.940
Transformation?

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:49.940
The boy was determined to open the queen’s hidden door.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.950
What he saw there was…

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.210
That’s…

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:12.930
She’s beautiful.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.530
Akira-kun, your hand…

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.030
You were the only one who I didn’t want to know this.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:36.780
But…

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.790
This is the reason why, a year ago,

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.920
I didn’t accept your confession.

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.600
Thank you for everything.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.510
I’ll be returning to where I’m supposed to be now.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.440
Akira-kun…

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:03.770
Akira-kun!

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.180
You have become stronger.

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:37.600
That little boy from the past no longer exists.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.270
Everyone…

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.820
Everyone has changed.

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:47.310
While they have changed, they have abandoned me, who is unable to change.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:49.270
I should have known.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.270
Princess.

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.400
I am the ruler of everything of the world of darkness.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:57.490
I am the one shunned by death itself,
the Queen of the Vampires.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.120
What does all that matter?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.120
What I had wished for…

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:04.500
…was something much more meager.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:10.380
In my life of perfidy and violence,

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:14.800
only your promise to me acted as my support.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:19.410
“I promise you.”

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:21.220
“I’ll protect you.”

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.180
“I’ll always be by your side.”

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:27.980
Those words alone were able to give me warmth.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:32.110
I was drawn into that warmth and came this far.

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:37.240
As a result, I obtained control of the kingdom.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.490
But what does that matter?

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:44.750
What I truly desired slipped out of these hands.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.790
Quite sad, eh? Feel free to laugh at me.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.330
Only I…

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.880
Only I am alone.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.380
No, Akira-kun.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.800
“But if you break that promise,

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.130
I will feast upon your flesh.”

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.390
“Even so, will you still make that promise?”

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:05.850
Stop!

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:08.390
“I will,”

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.480
said the young boy firmly.

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:14.770
“Then I will tell you my wish…”

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:44.600
You finally turned back, huh?

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:48.100
Akira, Akira!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.640
It’s okay.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.810
Werewolves are immortal.

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:53.440
Idiot, stop talking!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.730
I’m fine, so just listen.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.400
I’ve already died once.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.860
Then I met you once again.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.530
What brought me back from death…

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:08.620
…were your tears and that promise, after all.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:10.740
Akira…

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:15.130
I promise that I will never forget it again.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.250
We’ll always be together.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:18.880
Always.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:21.590
Akira…

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:43.910
The support votes from this case represents a majority,

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:45.740
so this motion is passed!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.420
Akira Kaburagi Regendorf.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.300
With the knightly power vested within me,

00:21:56.300 --> 00:21:59.000
I permit you to join the ranks of warriors.

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.690
I heard from Vera-san.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.530
The Prime Minister’s grandson, Shinya-kun,

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:25.450
received the vaccine and was sent home.

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:29.410
All the people at the church are fine, too.

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:30.320
Thank you.

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:31.750
Even so,

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:37.710
it does not change the fact that I used the children as shields and left a dark shadow in their hearts.

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:39.920
Well, Akira?

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:41.330
You really don’t regret this?

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:43.930
Of course not. I already told you.

00:22:43.930 --> 00:22:44.970
We’ll always be together.

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:01.230
To all citizens below:

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:02.150
Hear my words!

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:06.670
I hereby announce now that our kingdom of darkness,

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:09.360
that the Vampire Bund, has been formed!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:17.210
That was the story of a promise.

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:33.390
It was a small love tale about a great demon queen and the young man who offered her everything.

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:38.070
Dance with the Vampire Maids.

00:23:38.070 --> 00:23:39.020
Part Seven!

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:41.900
Akira still hasn’t been approved as my knight?

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:44.520
It’s appalling that he’s not being approved, but…

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:47.530
But he protected me with his body!

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.530
In that case, I can make another hole in him for Your Highness!

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:52.530
But then you will become a criminal.

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:55.530
If it’s for Your Highness, I’m fine with becoming a criminal.

00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:57.540
What kind of person are you?

00:23:57.540 --> 00:23:59.880
Hey, are you two going to talk or treat my wounds?

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.870
Your Highness, could you pass me that?
Hey, are you two going to talk or treat my wounds?

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:05.040
Don’t pass it through my hole!
